  m_text: Notice how the delivery zones are arranged from 10 to 100. They work just
    like a number line! The numbers get bigger as you move to the right, with each
    delivery zone 10 higher than the one before it. Look at the number line at the
    top of the screen to help you see where each delivery zone belongs.
